# Daily report — incremental

File: `.agent-workflow/reports/` using `dailyReport.filePattern` from `project.config.json`.

When a ticket milestone completes (QA verified, PR merged, deliverable shipped), append a task block with real `(H:MM hrs)` in the same session.

Read existing file first; merge; do not drop meeting blocks.

Log episodic memory when the outcome is verified (`proj-memory-bank.mdc`).
